# Raw ingested data and the DuckDB warehouse are bulky and regeneratable —
# see README for how to rebuild them. The small forecast/report outputs in
# data/processed/ and reports/ ARE committed: the dashboard (and a
# Streamlit Cloud deploy) reads them directly without needing the full
# multi-GB raw pipeline to have run in that environment.
data/raw/
data/db/*.duckdb
data/db/*.duckdb.wal
data/processed/models/

